@startuml
actor User
participant "Frontend" as FE
participant "Backend API" as API
participant "Database" as DB

User -> FE : Fill occurrence form
FE -> API : POST /occurrences
API -> DB : Check active occurrence
DB --> API : No active occurrence
API -> DB : Save occurrence
API -> DB : Save pets
API -> DB : Save images
API --> FE : Occurrence created
FE --> User : Confirmation
@enduml
